    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on the new affordable housing mandate for the district. We have a set number of units coming online and need to decide how to actually dole them out. People are arguing about lotteries vs income-based vs transit-proximate. In your professional opinion, what is the most equitable way to distribute these units?",
